        // travels FASTER than the thin tongue ahead of it: the body overtakes it and the front becomes
        // a shock. The old build did exactly the opposite — a 1.9x overdrive on the leading 2.7 km —
        // and stretched the head into 4-5 km of 2-8 m sheet, which is the 80-100 s of thin nose the
        // port beat used to frame. "body" is 1 in the surge and 0 in the leading tongue; the tongue
